        <profile name="6 Sleeper Agents" id="9c56-3dd9-be17-417f" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Move step, you may&apos;Activate Sleeper Agents&apos;. If you do, select an enemy infantry unit within 6&quot; of this unit. The selected enemy unit loses X Health, where X is equal to its worst Sv (if the unit has a 4+ Save, X is 4). Then, return a number of this unit&apos;s dead models to this unit equal to the number of enemy models that died.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Shadeblade" id="4fdb-3b61-1798-2e41" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">While this unit is ready, for each attack that targets it from a model more than 8&quot; away, worsen the Hit Roll of that attack by 1. After this unit is Activated, select one model in this unit. Until the End step, the selected model gains the following weapon:</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Denial Contingency" id="4d20-c7a5-0a17-a247" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, if that unit does not have Fly and is within 24&quot; of this unit, roll a D6. On a 4+, you may make attacks with the following weapon targeting that unit. If you do, this unit cannot use this ability again this battle round.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Mindveil" id="048d-cccb-d447-531d" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, if that unit is visible to this unit and within 24&quot; of this unit, you may roll a D6. On a 5+, this unit may Reposition, and may move through enemy models and terrain as if they were not there while doing so.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Hydra&apos;s Wail" id="f0ed-f4d6-39b1-b78d" hidden="true" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Move step, select an enemy unit visible to and within 12&quot; of this unit. All enemy units within 12&quot; of the selected unit suffer D6+2 Suppression.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
