          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Long War" id="7c2b-9a38-732a-9d20" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Black Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After rolling for initiative during battle round 1, select one enemy unit. That enemy unit and all enemy units of the same name gain Abaddon&apos;s Contempt. After rolling for initiative during battle round 2, select a vault at random. For the rest of the battle, after any of your units capture that vault, all enemy units gain Abaddon&apos;s Contempt for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="4664-cd3f-b95b-a458" childName="Black Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Misinformation Architect" id="9958-5bf0-24a4-eeaa" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per battle round, after any enemy unit is Activated, you may select one of your ready units within 24&quot; of this unit. Remove the selected unit from the battlefield and place it into reserves.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Iron Cage Doctrine" id="efbe-63af-d868-6205" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Iron Warriors</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Move step, you may select a point in the battlefield within 16&quot; of this unit and mark it. Until the next time this unit is Activated or dies, for each attack made by any of your unit&apos;s models which targets an enemy unit within 16&quot; of the centre of that point, reroll a Wound Roll of 1 for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="27b0-cf36-cd17-73c6" childName="Iron Warriors" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Iron Within" id="2be0-93a5-e801-5d38" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Iron Warriors</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After any of your units with Suppressed X Activate within 16&quot; of this unit, reduce X by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="27b0-cf36-cd17-73c6" childName="Iron Warriors" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Iron Without" id="41a7-a695-893f-4449" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Iron Warriors</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While your units are within 16&quot; of this unit, those units gain Resilient 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="27b0-cf36-cd17-73c6" childName="Iron Warriors" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Terror Tactics" id="8f95-fe43-cd0c-e0eb" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Night Lords</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While your units are within 24&quot; of this unit, those units gain the following abilities: 

We Bring The Night: After this unit is Activated, select an enemy unit not visible to this unit. Once this turn, after this unit finishes a Pile In within engagement range of that unit this turn, that unit suffers 2D3 Suppression.

Cruel Ambush: Each melee weapon equipped to models in this unit gains Isolate.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="1fa8-6666-7875-be1b" childName="Night Lords" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Abaddon&apos;s Contempt" id="60ce-184f-ea5d-ca84" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Black Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each attack made by a Chaos Space Marines unit that targets this unit, that attack gains Critical Hits 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="4664-cd3f-b95b-a458" childName="Black Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Clandestine Deployment" id="50bc-66c8-0bdd-9edd" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After any of your units are Activated in reserves, you may Deploy that unit anywhere in the battlefield not visible to any enemy units, and not within 2D6+8&quot; of the enemy deployment zone. That unit cannot Advance or Reposition this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Multi-Headed Hydra" id="3427-67ac-8138-76c6" hidden="true" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <comment>Alpha Legion</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit dies, roll a D6. On a 3+, select a friendly infantry model in the battlefield. That model becomes a leader, and its unit gains Clandestine Deployment, Misinformation Architect, Multi-Headed Hydra, and Selfish Ascension.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="d592-5a78-0580-1d03" childName="Alpha Legion" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
