        <selectionEntry name="Malefic Discipline" id="53a1-e879-d795-5026" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="3995-9f00-6cff-00bd-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="3995-9f00-6cff-00bd-max" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="1 Pact of Flesh" id="3f68-6860-2930-1da2" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select a friendly infantry unit within 6&quot; of this unit. If the selected unit is a POSSESSED unit, add 1 POSSESSED model to that unit. Otherwise, it Heals D3+1 instead.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="2 Cursed Earth" id="d494-f47c-1641-d325" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select a point in the battlefield within 24&quot; of this unit and mark it. Until the end of the battle round, enemy units within 16&quot; of the selected point gain Dark Gods&apos;Hatred.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="3 Infernal Power" id="feee-22ec-1f3c-7b9c" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Until the next time this unit Activates or dies, while your units with Daemonic are within 16” of this unit, those units gain the following ability:


Daemonic Strength: For each attack made for this unit, a Wound Roll of 6 for that attack causes an additional wound.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="4 Sacrifice" id="e9e8-a609-2de4-58be" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select a friendly infantry unit within 12&quot; of this unit. The selected unit loses D3+1 Health. Then, select a different friendly infantry unit within 12&quot; of this unit. That selected unit Heals X, where X is equal to the result of that roll. If that unit has Daemonic, it Heals X+D3 instead.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="5 Agonizing Ritual" id="79f1-2185-5ae1-1939" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select an infantry model with 2 or more Health remaining from one of your units within 12&quot; of this unit. The selected model dies. Then, if there are any friendly POSSESSED units in the battlefield, add 1 POSSESSED model to one of those units. Otherwise, create a ready POSSESSED unit within 1&quot; of this unit with 1 model.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="6 Mutating Possession" id="9fb1-5bc3-870a-538a" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you select targets for this unit this turn, select an enemy unit with Dark Gods&apos;Hatred, visible to and within 16&quot; of this unit. The selected enemy unit suffers 2D3+1 SW. Then, if one or more models died as a result of those SW, create a ready POSSESSED unit with 1 model within 2&quot; and outside of the engagement range of that enemy unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="leader" id="60fa-1572-7738-ed79" hidden="false">
