            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit Activates, you must select one other unit within 4&quot; of this unit (if able). If you did, the selected unit suffers 4 SW and until the End step, during an Advance, this unit may move up to an additional 4&quot; if that move would end within 4&quot; of any enemy units.</characteristic>
